libdtfl (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First development release.  A C11 port of timely dataflow
    (timely-v0.31.0), differential dataflow (differential-dataflow-
    v0.25.1), and the timely diagnostics tools.
  * Known limitation: performance behind the Rust originals on the
    arrange and count benchmarks.

